  "solution": "1. - and +\n\n__**625 ÷ 25**__ - 7 × 318 + 112 = 381\n\n⇒ 25 - __7 × 318__ + 112 = 381\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 2226 __**+**____** 112**__ = 381\n\n⇒ __**137 -**____** 2226**__ = 381 \n\n⇒ -2089 ≠ 381\n\n2. ÷ and +\n\n625 + __**25 ÷ 7**__ × 318 - 112 = 381\n\n⇒ 625 + __**3.57 × 318**__ - 112 = 381\n\n⇒ __**625 + 1135.26**__ - 112 = 381\n\n⇒ __**1760.26 - 112**__ = 381\n\n⇒ 1648.26 ≠ 381\n\n3. ÷ and -\n\n625 - 25 + 7 × __**318 ÷ 112**__ = 381\n\n⇒ 625 - 25 + __**7 × 2.83**__ = 381\n\n⇒ __**625**__ - 25 __**+ 19.81**__ = 381\n\n⇒ __**644.81 -**____** 25**__ = 381\n\n⇒ 619.81 ≠ 381\n\n4. + and ×\n\n__625 ÷ 25__ × 7 + 318 - 112 = 381\n\n⇒ __25 ____×____ 7__ + 318 - 112 = 381\n\n⇒ __175____ +____ 318__ - 112 = 381\n\n⇒ __493 - 112__ = 381\n\n⇒ 381 = 381\n\nHence, '**+ and ×**' is the correct answer.",
